"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*とにかく読んで読んで覚えたよ！q(^-^q)\n大変だったよ......(´・ω・`)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上    沢山質問やアンダーライヴの事、乃木どこ、乃木てん、れなりんの事等々コメントをくれてありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事や夏期講習、勉強合宿、ホラー映画の役等  応援してるよ！\n頑張って＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/01/2509070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/01/2509070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/01/2509070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/01/2509070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！さっきメンバーとanimalの話したとき堀ちゃんにね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ほっちゃんセキセイインコ飼ってそう＼(^-^)／』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『セキセイインコってめっちゃ怖くないですか？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『え？ええ！？なんで？！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『近所のペットショップ屋さんに大きな鳥がいて、そしたら\n『いらっしゃいませ』\nってその鳥しゃべったんです！だからもう恐くて......(´・ω・`)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを聞いて確かにインコは教えたら話すのは知ってたけど、大きいってなに！？って思ったのよ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらさすが堀ちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとね！なんとなんとね！"},{"